<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Femco dips into black in eight month period.</title>
<headline>Femco dips into black in eight month period.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eight months ended December 31, 1996 compared to year ended April 30, 1995</p>
<p>			    (million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     0.4 gain    vs 55.1 loss</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   0.25 gain   vs 21.86 loss</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   0.66 gain   vs 12.85 loss</p>
<p>    Turnover		  44.41	 vs 62.49</p>
<p>Full name: Femco Technology Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>NOTE -  The firm said its restructuring proces was going well. The unusual comparative figures are due to a change in the firm's year end accounting date.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
